1
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:13,680
The little money
for your mom's medical bills

2
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:14,840
is nothing to me.

3
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:16,840
Most importantly,

4
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:17,880
who else but me

5
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:19,400
would be so generous

6
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:20,600
to lend you money?

7
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:23,000
Here is the IOU.

8
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:25,250
I will definitely pay you back.

9
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:25,960
And

10
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:28,120
about last time,

11
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:30,480
I won't report you to the police.

12
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:32,960
Report me?

13
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:36,800
It was just date rape.

14
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:40,460
I dared to do it,

15
00:00:42,320 --> 00:00:44,320
so I'm not afraid of being reported.

16
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:48,180
I've already given you the money.

17
00:00:48,720 --> 00:00:49,600
Can I

18
00:00:52,080 --> 00:00:54,080
collect some interest first today?

19
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:56,280
What do you want?

20
00:00:57,360 --> 00:00:58,600
What do I want?

21
00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:07,640
Who do you think

22
00:01:07,640 --> 00:01:09,760
is standing up for Li Ran like this?

23
00:01:12,960 --> 00:01:13,880
There's absolutely nothing

24
00:01:13,880 --> 00:01:15,720
about a miscarriage in our files.

25
00:01:15,720 --> 00:01:17,800
The police checked
Li Ran's medical records.

26
00:01:17,800 --> 00:01:18,800
There's no such entry.

27
00:01:18,800 --> 00:01:21,520
She probably didn't have
the surgery at a public hospital.

28
00:01:21,520 --> 00:01:22,240
Here's what we do.

29
00:01:22,240 --> 00:01:23,240
Contact the police

30
00:01:23,240 --> 00:01:25,160
to review Li Ran's social connections

31
00:01:25,160 --> 00:01:27,020
and supplement the information.

32
00:01:27,080 --> 00:01:27,410
Okay.

33
00:01:27,880 --> 00:01:28,940
Are you busy later?

34
00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:30,640
Asking me out?

35
00:01:32,360 --> 00:01:33,560
I have an appointment with a witness.

36
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:35,520
In August 2021,

37
00:01:35,520 --> 00:01:37,320
he accidentally injured Xue Mei.

38
00:01:37,320 --> 00:01:38,400
She was hospitalized
for over half a month,

39
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:39,660
costing over 100,000.

40
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:41,240
You think there's something
wrong with this?

41
00:01:41,240 --> 00:01:42,700
We'll know when we see him.

42
00:01:43,240 --> 00:01:43,570
Okay.

43
00:01:44,240 --> 00:01:45,240
It's been over two years

44
00:01:45,240 --> 00:01:46,920
since this happened.

45
00:01:47,160 --> 00:01:47,560
I

46
00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:48,960
really didn't expect it

47
00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:50,479
to be brought up again.

48
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:52,200
We just brought you here today

49
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:53,680
to verify some questions.

50
00:01:54,160 --> 00:01:54,880
Go ahead.

51
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:56,600
You clearly had money,

52
00:01:57,039 --> 00:01:59,370
yet you deliberately divorced your wife.

53
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:01,840
You transferred all your assets

54
00:02:01,960 --> 00:02:03,960
just so you wouldn't have to pay a dime

55
00:02:03,960 --> 00:02:05,280
when the court enforced the ruling.

56
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:05,940
Why is that?

57
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:07,920
I was forced to do this.

58
00:02:08,360 --> 00:02:09,440
I owed

59
00:02:09,600 --> 00:02:11,600
exactly 150,000 in debt at the time.

60
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:14,370
Mr. Wang,

61
00:02:15,600 --> 00:02:17,040
if this gets done,

62
00:02:17,600 --> 00:02:19,560
this 200,000 is all yours.

63
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:26,400
What if

64
00:02:26,720 --> 00:02:27,850
I end up killing her?

65
00:02:28,680 --> 00:02:30,410
You're an experienced driver.

66
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:32,400
You know how to hold back.

67
00:02:33,079 --> 00:02:33,360
But

68
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:36,079
the person you pointed out to me,

69
00:02:36,079 --> 00:02:37,010
she's a cripple.

70
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:38,600
What if there's an accident...

71
00:02:38,600 --> 00:02:40,320
There are no 'what ifs.'

72
00:02:41,920 --> 00:02:43,680
As long as you keep your mouth shut,

73
00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:46,480
the boss will take good care
of you and your family.

74
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:49,600
The money is right here.

75
00:02:50,040 --> 00:02:51,840
It's up to you whether to take it.

76
00:02:54,880 --> 00:02:57,440
He only told you
to injure Xue Mei back then.

77
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:58,440
Yeah,

78
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:00,480
he just told me

79
00:03:00,480 --> 00:03:01,960
to injure Xue Mei.

80
00:03:01,960 --> 00:03:03,420
That's why I dared to do it.

81
00:03:03,640 --> 00:03:04,170
I suspect

82
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:05,760
they might have

83
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:07,760
a little grudge against each other.

84
00:03:07,760 --> 00:03:09,560
But I didn't dare to ask too much.

85
00:03:09,760 --> 00:03:12,020
Is your divorce with your wife a fake one?

86
00:03:16,160 --> 00:03:17,880
It was supposed to be a fake divorce,

87
00:03:17,880 --> 00:03:19,610
but she ran away with the money.

88
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:22,250
What goes around comes around.

89
00:03:25,320 --> 00:03:27,720
What do you think about
what just happened?

90
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:28,680
I think

91
00:03:28,920 --> 00:03:30,960
it's more than just a simple collision.

92
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:33,020
It must be setting up something else.

93
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:35,960
I don't object to personal intuition,

94
00:03:35,960 --> 00:03:38,400
but why did you think
of contacting that person?

95
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:40,800
You've been acting mysterious lately too.

96
00:03:41,200 --> 00:03:41,640
How about it?

97
00:03:41,640 --> 00:03:42,440
Got time later

98
00:03:42,920 --> 00:03:44,250
to meet someone with me?

99
00:03:44,440 --> 00:03:46,840
I'm waiting for
a handwriting analysis result,

100
00:03:46,840 --> 00:03:48,840
and I have to meet someone later too.

101
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,380
Let Kaixin go with you.

102
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:52,610
Okay.

103
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:55,480
Wei,

104
00:03:57,240 --> 00:03:58,570
Take it at your own pace.

105
00:03:58,640 --> 00:03:59,880
You'll be told everything

106
00:03:59,880 --> 00:04:01,140
when the time is right.

107
00:04:08,480 --> 00:04:09,810
Why is no one here today?

108
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:12,880
Knowing you two prosecutors are coming,

109
00:04:12,880 --> 00:04:14,280
who would dare to show up?

110
00:04:14,920 --> 00:04:17,839
Wei Feng had someone put
Li Ran's mother in the hospital, right?

111
00:04:17,839 --> 00:04:18,640
Not bad.

112
00:04:18,959 --> 00:04:21,560
You investigated much faster
than I expected.

113
00:04:21,640 --> 00:04:23,840
That's because you underestimated us.

114
00:04:24,520 --> 00:04:26,520
He was the one who threatened Li Ran.

115
00:04:26,960 --> 00:04:30,080
Li Ran's family relies on Wei Feng
for financial support.

116
00:04:30,080 --> 00:04:31,540
He had no reason to do that.

117
00:04:33,280 --> 00:04:34,480
Think about it again.

118
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:35,960
Wei Feng wanted

119
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:37,240
to control Li Ran.

120
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:38,280
Then

121
00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:40,720
he did it to make Li Ran take his money.

122
00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:41,440
No,

123
00:04:42,360 --> 00:04:44,820
it was to make Li Ran
willingly owe him money.

124
00:04:48,640 --> 00:04:49,680
As expected of Prosecutor Fang.

125
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:50,740
You catch on quick.

126
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:52,440
Wei Feng did that

127
00:04:52,440 --> 00:04:54,500
just to force Li Ran to take his money.

128
00:04:54,520 --> 00:04:56,320
What if Li Ran borrowed from someone else?

129
00:04:56,320 --> 00:04:56,760
Who else

130
00:04:56,760 --> 00:04:58,560
around her do you think is as rich

131
00:04:59,320 --> 00:04:59,880
and generous

132
00:04:59,880 --> 00:05:00,640
as Wei Feng?

133
00:05:04,520 --> 00:05:06,180
Even if she got away this time,

134
00:05:06,640 --> 00:05:07,920
there would be a next time.

135
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:09,650
Wei Feng was determined to win.

136
00:05:12,320 --> 00:05:14,480
That's why I look down on him.

137
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:16,850
With his disregard for the law,

138
00:05:16,960 --> 00:05:18,560
he's doomed sooner or later.

139
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:21,640
So Li Ran and Wei Feng weren't lovers.

140
00:05:22,080 --> 00:05:23,680
He was forcing her all along.

141
00:05:25,880 --> 00:05:26,960
On March 7th,

142
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:30,240
why did Wei Feng suddenly invite you
to the Sirius Mountain Resort

143
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:31,640
instead of planning it in advance?

144
00:05:31,640 --> 00:05:33,400
I have no idea about that.

145
00:05:34,080 --> 00:05:36,280
Anyway, I was drinking nearby

146
00:05:36,760 --> 00:05:37,560
and had nothing to do,

147
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:38,360
so I went over.

148
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:40,120
Until what time did you guys hang out?

149
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:41,450
Around 2:00 or 3:00 a.m.

150
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:43,480
He said he'd been busy
with the wedding lately

151
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:44,740
and hadn't slept much.

152
00:05:44,960 --> 00:05:45,920
He kept yawning.

153
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:47,159
Then we called it a night.

154
00:05:47,159 --> 00:05:48,440
What about the hotel's

155
00:05:48,440 --> 00:05:49,770
surveillance cameras?

156
00:05:50,840 --> 00:05:52,770
Camera maintenance is just a code.

157
00:05:53,320 --> 00:05:54,780
You know, for some things,

158
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:56,440
it's inconvenient to have the cameras on,

159
00:05:56,440 --> 00:05:56,840
right?

160
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:59,300
Why are you suddenly telling us this?

161
00:05:59,760 --> 00:06:01,960
Aren't you afraid
of offending your partners?

162
00:06:01,960 --> 00:06:03,560
What do I have to be afraid of?

163
00:06:03,880 --> 00:06:04,920
Do you think they

164
00:06:06,080 --> 00:06:07,340
can even compare to me?

165
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:11,600
I think you still
don't know me well enough,

166
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:12,600
Prosecutor Fang.

167
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:13,850
That's fine.

168
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:15,290
I believe we'll have

169
00:06:15,440 --> 00:06:16,800
more chances in the future.

170
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:18,080
We've got the picture.

171
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:20,080
Thank you for your cooperation.

172
00:06:20,080 --> 00:06:20,960
We'll contact you

173
00:06:20,960 --> 00:06:22,360
if we need anything else.

174
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:24,410
My pleasure.

175
00:06:44,960 --> 00:06:45,760
The interview is over.

176
00:06:45,760 --> 00:06:46,890
I can take calls now.

177
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:49,240
It's fine.

178
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:51,040
Wei,

179
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:53,000
is he into you?

180
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:54,720
Is he even worthy?

181
00:06:54,760 --> 00:06:57,159
Then why did he give us
so much information?

182
00:06:58,360 --> 00:06:59,960
He must be in a good mood.

183
00:07:00,280 --> 00:07:02,440
Weihong Group's stock
plummeted a few days ago.

184
00:07:02,440 --> 00:07:03,880
He bought the dip and made a fortune.

185
00:07:03,880 --> 00:07:04,880
How did you know?

186
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:06,370
Don't you read the news?

187
00:07:06,640 --> 00:07:08,520
When a whale falls, an ecosystem thrives.

188
00:07:08,520 --> 00:07:11,050
These companies are only
bound by interests.

189
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:11,720
This morning,

190
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:14,520
the cyber police shared a list
of banned marketing accounts.

191
00:07:14,520 --> 00:07:17,040
Many accounts exposing Wei Feng's scandals

192
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:19,770
are affiliated with
Liang Dong's media company.

193
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:22,850
So it really is the big fish
eating the small ones.

194
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:24,680
The bigger the storm,

195
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:25,680
the easier it is

196
00:07:25,880 --> 00:07:27,680
for hidden evidence to surface.

197
00:07:32,520 --> 00:07:33,200
Chang,

198
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:35,820
a victim's family member
is looking for you.

199
00:07:35,960 --> 00:07:37,420
A victim's family member?

200
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:38,000
Yeah.

201
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:39,520
She has trouble walking.

202
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:40,740
Come back quickly.

203
00:07:40,960 --> 00:07:42,290
Don't keep her waiting.

204
00:07:44,080 --> 00:07:46,120
Li Ran's mother went to the office
to look for us.

205
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:46,520
Get in.

206
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:55,000
Xie Mengqiao, right?

207
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:57,000
Hello,

208
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:58,480
we're from the Prosecutor's Office.

209
00:07:58,480 --> 00:08:01,210
I'm Xu Yishan, a prosecutor
from Department One.

210
00:08:01,280 --> 00:08:03,000
This is clerk Zhou Yan.

211
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:07,080
So you found me after all.

212
00:08:07,400 --> 00:08:08,960
Would you two like to order something?

213
00:08:08,960 --> 00:08:09,480
Nothing for now,

214
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:09,960
thanks.

215
00:08:12,400 --> 00:08:14,040
You never intended to hide it anyway.

216
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:15,000
Otherwise,

217
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:16,840
you would have typed it all out,

218
00:08:16,840 --> 00:08:19,360
and wouldn't have left
your handwriting on the cover.

219
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:20,220
Prosecutor Xu,

220
00:08:20,840 --> 00:08:22,700
the handwriting analysis is out.

221
00:08:23,080 --> 00:08:25,210
It was indeed written by Xie Mengqiao.

222
00:08:26,840 --> 00:08:28,760
I did write the whistle-blowing letter.

223
00:08:28,760 --> 00:08:29,890
Why did you write it?

224
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:34,280
Because there's a lot of fake news
about Li Ran online right now.

225
00:08:34,280 --> 00:08:36,480
I was afraid you'd actually believe it.

226
00:08:37,360 --> 00:08:38,840
Tell us about

227
00:08:39,159 --> 00:08:40,760
your relationship with Li Ran today.

228
00:08:40,760 --> 00:08:42,320
We went to the same university,

229
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:43,919
but we had different majors.

230
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:46,720
But we bumped into each other
at the library every day,

231
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:47,800
and over time,

232
00:08:48,040 --> 00:08:49,370
we became good friends.

233
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:51,520
Then why did you

234
00:08:51,520 --> 00:08:52,580
drift apart later?

235
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:56,040
During the summer vacation
of our junior year,

236
00:08:56,040 --> 00:08:57,440
Li Ran suddenly came to me

237
00:08:57,680 --> 00:09:00,210
and said she was drugged
and raped by Wei Feng.

238
00:09:00,960 --> 00:09:04,560
But at that time, I had just received
an offer from Weihong Group.

239
00:09:16,440 --> 00:09:18,480
Are you sure that was Wei Feng?

240
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:21,320
I recognized his cologne.

241
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:23,240
It must be him.

242
00:09:25,040 --> 00:09:25,640
Ran,

243
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:27,770
what are you going to do?

244
00:09:28,440 --> 00:09:30,170
Are you going to press charges?

245
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:31,800
I don't know.

246
00:09:35,160 --> 00:09:35,680
Ran,

247
00:09:37,160 --> 00:09:38,890
you have to think this through.

248
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:41,120
With Wei Feng's family background,

249
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:43,580
things like this won't affect him at all.

250
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:45,960
But you're different.

251
00:09:47,040 --> 00:09:48,770
Can you bear the consequences?

252
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:51,920
I don't know.

253
00:09:53,040 --> 00:09:53,760
Ran,

254
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:56,680
if you're going to sue him,

255
00:09:57,640 --> 00:09:59,640
I might not be able to help you.

256
00:10:05,160 --> 00:10:07,040
You know my family situation.

257
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:09,880
I just got an offer from Weihong Group.

258
00:10:11,040 --> 00:10:12,960
I can't take this risk with you.

259
00:10:14,160 --> 00:10:15,320
I'm sorry.

260
00:10:19,280 --> 00:10:20,320
I understand.

261
00:10:21,760 --> 00:10:23,080
I know as her friend,

262
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:24,880
I should encourage and help her.

263
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:26,530
But I was really too scared.

264
00:10:27,600 --> 00:10:29,440
If I offended Weihong Group,

265
00:10:29,920 --> 00:10:32,650
other companies would shut
their doors on me too.

266
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:34,880
I couldn't lose this job.

267
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:38,090
What happened next?

268
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:39,210
Afterwards,

269
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:41,720
she didn't dare to call the police either.

270
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:44,320
Then Wei Feng started
pursuing her secretly.

271
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:46,570
She avoided him for a long time.

272
00:10:46,640 --> 00:10:48,700
But because her family needed money,

273
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:50,650
she eventually gave in.

274
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:52,880
The day she gave in,

275
00:10:53,520 --> 00:10:55,320
we held each other and cried.

276
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:57,280
She suddenly forgave me.

277
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:01,200
I think it might be because of the money.

278
00:11:01,840 --> 00:11:03,040
But she also said

279
00:11:03,560 --> 00:11:05,840
we should pretend not to know
each other from then on.

280
00:11:05,840 --> 00:11:07,400
Why pretend not to know each other?

281
00:11:07,400 --> 00:11:09,200
Han Jiatong is not someone to mess with.

282
00:11:09,200 --> 00:11:11,130
She secretly dealt with every girl

283
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:14,600
who got too close to Wei Feng.

284
00:11:14,920 --> 00:11:15,640
How so?

285
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,130
In what way exactly?

286
00:11:17,240 --> 00:11:17,840
Just...

287
00:11:18,040 --> 00:11:20,040
asserting her dominance and stuff.

288
00:11:20,800 --> 00:11:22,400
Anyway, she's very cunning.

289
00:11:22,640 --> 00:11:23,840
Does Han Jiatong know

290
00:11:23,960 --> 00:11:25,960
about Li Ran and Wei Feng's relationship?

291
00:11:25,960 --> 00:11:27,080
Probably not.

292
00:11:27,840 --> 00:11:29,400
Otherwise, she would have done everything

293
00:11:29,400 --> 00:11:31,480
to kick Ran out of the group.

294
00:11:32,920 --> 00:11:35,180
What about the part in your report letter

295
00:11:35,280 --> 00:11:36,080
where you said

296
00:11:36,400 --> 00:11:37,640
Li Ran had an abortion?

297
00:11:37,640 --> 00:11:38,880
Last October,

298
00:11:39,320 --> 00:11:41,120
Ran got pregnant accidentally.

299
00:11:41,640 --> 00:11:43,570
But she had an abortion soon after.

300
00:11:47,160 --> 00:11:48,880
There's 30,000 in this card.

301
00:11:49,520 --> 00:11:51,320
It's what Ran saved up this year.

302
00:11:53,200 --> 00:11:55,920
Before she died,
she kept saying she wanted to quit.

303
00:11:55,920 --> 00:11:58,250
She always wanted to escape from Wei Feng.

304
00:11:59,160 --> 00:12:00,360
This is Li Ran's card?

305
00:12:01,200 --> 00:12:03,200
We've checked all her card records.

306
00:12:03,800 --> 00:12:05,000
This one isn't there.

307
00:12:05,040 --> 00:12:06,360
This card is mine.

308
00:12:07,200 --> 00:12:09,840
Ran was saving money before,
and Wei Feng found out

309
00:12:09,840 --> 00:12:10,570
and beat her.

310
00:12:11,520 --> 00:12:12,850
To hide it from Wei Feng,

311
00:12:12,920 --> 00:12:14,120
she borrowed my card.

312
00:12:14,520 --> 00:12:15,840
From what you're saying,

313
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:18,400
Wei Feng was very controlling over Li Ran.

314
00:12:18,720 --> 00:12:20,440
Wei Feng usually gets tired of other women

315
00:12:20,440 --> 00:12:21,800
in a month or two,

316
00:12:22,040 --> 00:12:24,600
but he's been pestering Ran
for over two years.

317
00:12:24,600 --> 00:12:26,920
He just takes pleasure in forcing her.

318
00:12:32,360 --> 00:12:32,960
Dad,

319
00:12:33,520 --> 00:12:36,040
Xue Mei just refuses to sign
the letter of forgiveness.

320
00:12:36,040 --> 00:12:37,240
She's so stubborn.

321
00:12:37,520 --> 00:12:38,520
What should we do?

322
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:40,060
What else can we do?

323
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:42,520
If the soft approach doesn't work,
we use force.

324
00:12:42,520 --> 00:12:43,640
Nonsense!

325
00:12:44,080 --> 00:12:45,480
How many times have I told you?

326
00:12:45,480 --> 00:12:46,880
Don't make things worse.

327
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:47,880
I'd better

328
00:12:48,400 --> 00:12:49,280
discuss this with

329
00:12:49,280 --> 00:12:50,240
Lawyer Qin.

330
00:12:51,040 --> 00:12:51,680
Wei,

331
00:12:52,000 --> 00:12:53,800
is Lawyer Qin really up to the task?

332
00:12:53,800 --> 00:12:55,330
He said if we blow things up,

333
00:12:55,440 --> 00:12:57,440
we could seize the initiative
in public opinion.

334
00:12:57,440 --> 00:12:58,640
But now the internet is

335
00:12:58,640 --> 00:13:00,000
full of dirt on Feng.

336
00:13:00,280 --> 00:13:01,280
Lawyer Qin

337
00:13:01,440 --> 00:13:03,040
was introduced by Old Liang.

338
00:13:03,720 --> 00:13:05,200
He is on the right track.

339
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:06,240
I guess

340
00:13:06,360 --> 00:13:07,880
someone is sabotaging us
behind the scenes.

341
00:13:07,880 --> 00:13:09,360
They are just taking advantage
of the situation.

342
00:13:09,360 --> 00:13:10,560
But if this continues,

343
00:13:10,560 --> 00:13:13,160
the procuratorate will never
let Xiaofeng go.

344
00:13:13,160 --> 00:13:14,400
Don't do anything.

345
00:13:16,440 --> 00:13:17,040
Just wait.

346
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:18,360
You can afford to wait,

347
00:13:18,360 --> 00:13:19,760
but your son can't.

348
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:21,800
Inaction is better than action.

349
00:13:23,160 --> 00:13:25,680
Do you know how people out there
are cursing your son?

350
00:13:25,680 --> 00:13:28,000
And you are still sitting here
pretending to wait patiently.

351
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:28,660
Wei Qishan,

352
00:13:28,880 --> 00:13:30,040
let me tell you.

353
00:13:30,480 --> 00:13:32,080
If your method doesn't work,

354
00:13:32,160 --> 00:13:34,040
I'll solve it my way.

355
00:13:35,600 --> 00:13:37,080
What are you going to do?

356
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:39,120
Find a psychopath

357
00:13:39,120 --> 00:13:40,120
to kill Xue Mei.

358
00:13:41,080 --> 00:13:42,810
I think you are the psychopath.

359
00:13:43,240 --> 00:13:44,600
Let me finish.

360
00:13:45,760 --> 00:13:47,800
Didn't the surveillance footage
at Li Ran's community go missing?

361
00:13:47,800 --> 00:13:50,080
We'll say the psychopath did it all.

362
00:13:50,680 --> 00:13:53,010
Why are they still holding on to Xiaofeng?

363
00:13:53,320 --> 00:13:55,800
Isn't it
because there are no other suspects?

364
00:13:55,800 --> 00:13:56,800
To save Xiaofeng,

365
00:13:57,160 --> 00:13:59,280
we have to hand over a new suspect.

366
00:13:59,800 --> 00:14:00,400
No.

367
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:02,130
The risk is too high.

368
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:04,660
I knew I couldn't count on you.

369
00:14:06,360 --> 00:14:07,160
Dad,

370
00:14:07,720 --> 00:14:09,080
I think what Mom said

371
00:14:09,520 --> 00:14:10,640
makes sense.

372
00:14:11,960 --> 00:14:13,200
Do you think so too?

373
00:14:13,960 --> 00:14:15,620
If we want to get Xiaofeng out,

374
00:14:15,920 --> 00:14:18,580
we need someone else
to divert their attention.

375
00:14:19,080 --> 00:14:19,720
We

376
00:14:20,560 --> 00:14:22,820
have to give the procuratorate a way out.

377
00:14:23,960 --> 00:14:25,840
I think Xiaotong has a point.

378
00:14:30,360 --> 00:14:31,360
Xie Mengqiao's testimony

379
00:14:31,360 --> 00:14:32,360
and the bank card,

380
00:14:32,600 --> 00:14:35,160
our colleagues in the tech department
are already coordinating with the police.

381
00:14:35,160 --> 00:14:36,760
The results will be out soon.

382
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:42,480
There is indeed a record
of Li Ran's miscarriage.

383
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:44,210
She came to the ER half a year ago

384
00:14:44,280 --> 00:14:45,720
and was discharged the same day.

385
00:14:45,720 --> 00:14:47,080
What was the cause of the miscarriage?

386
00:14:47,080 --> 00:14:49,960
Drug components were found
in both her blood and urine

387
00:14:49,960 --> 00:14:52,080
at the time.

388
00:14:52,400 --> 00:14:54,800
It was mifepristone and misoprostol,

389
00:14:55,120 --> 00:14:56,360
indicating a medical abortion.

390
00:14:56,360 --> 00:14:59,160
You can directly detect
the components of abortion drugs?

391
00:14:59,160 --> 00:15:01,200
Of course, we wouldn't
test for that proactively.

392
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:03,960
The patient requested it
herself at the time.

393
00:15:05,040 --> 00:15:05,960
She seemed

394
00:15:06,160 --> 00:15:07,920
very surprised about her miscarriage,

395
00:15:07,920 --> 00:15:09,080
so she got tested.

396
00:15:11,440 --> 00:15:12,040
Ms. Xue,

397
00:15:12,320 --> 00:15:14,720
just call me directly next time
if you need anything.

398
00:15:14,720 --> 00:15:16,650
You don't have to come all this way.

399
00:15:17,680 --> 00:15:18,640
Thank you, sir.

400
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:20,400
Watch your step.

401
00:15:32,680 --> 00:15:34,540
Let me get the door for you, ma'am.

402
00:15:58,560 --> 00:15:59,960
Watch your step, Ms. Xue.

403
00:16:02,720 --> 00:16:03,580
Captain Zheng,

404
00:16:04,520 --> 00:16:06,560
when I took Li Ran's mother
back to the guest house,

405
00:16:06,560 --> 00:16:07,890
I found the window open.

406
00:16:09,320 --> 00:16:10,720
There was a suspicious person downstairs.

407
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:12,250
Please help us look into it.

408
00:16:13,040 --> 00:16:15,800
Ma'am, has anyone come
looking for you recently?

409
00:16:17,560 --> 00:16:18,960
Just a Mr. Wei.

410
00:16:18,960 --> 00:16:20,680
He wanted me to sign
a settlement agreement.

411
00:16:20,680 --> 00:16:21,840
I didn't agree.

412
00:16:21,840 --> 00:16:23,040
He even offered me money.

413
00:16:23,040 --> 00:16:24,040
I didn't take it.

414
00:16:27,040 --> 00:16:28,300
This place is too damp.

415
00:16:28,560 --> 00:16:30,090
Let's move somewhere else.

416
00:16:35,280 --> 00:16:37,080
You locals are really rude.

417
00:16:37,760 --> 00:16:38,480
We had a deal.

418
00:16:38,480 --> 00:16:40,080
How could you just cancel it?

419
00:16:40,480 --> 00:16:41,280
I don't care.

420
00:16:41,720 --> 00:16:42,600
Even if the job isn't done,

421
00:16:42,600 --> 00:16:44,130
I'm not taking a penny less.

422
00:16:46,320 --> 00:16:47,040
Wei,

423
00:16:47,280 --> 00:16:49,960
I find you quite cold on the outside
but warm on the inside.

424
00:16:49,960 --> 00:16:52,720
Although sometimes what you say
is really annoying,

425
00:16:52,720 --> 00:16:53,680
on second thought,

426
00:16:53,680 --> 00:16:55,480
your intentions are quite pure.

427
00:16:56,160 --> 00:16:58,040
I just want to handle the case well.

428
00:16:58,040 --> 00:17:00,300
You just want to handle the case too well.

429
00:17:01,280 --> 00:17:04,000
Yishan found out
about Li Ran's miscarriage.

430
00:17:04,359 --> 00:17:06,160
I'm going back to work overtime.

431
00:17:06,319 --> 00:17:08,160
You can go home and rest
if you have nothing else to do.

432
00:17:08,160 --> 00:17:09,119
I'm not going home.

433
00:17:09,119 --> 00:17:10,720
I'll work overtime with you.

434
00:17:11,920 --> 00:17:13,359
It's off-duty time now.

435
00:17:13,640 --> 00:17:15,560
You can allocate your time freely.

436
00:17:15,560 --> 00:17:17,280
I really don't want to go home.

437
00:17:17,280 --> 00:17:18,560
I even want to move out.

438
00:17:19,280 --> 00:17:20,640
Does our unit have apartments?

439
00:17:20,640 --> 00:17:21,520
Can I apply for one?

440
00:17:21,520 --> 00:17:22,000
No.

441
00:17:23,400 --> 00:17:24,079
Okay.

442
00:17:24,560 --> 00:17:25,359
Otherwise,

443
00:17:25,359 --> 00:17:27,839
I could move in right now

444
00:17:28,079 --> 00:17:29,920
and work even harder in the future.

445
00:17:29,920 --> 00:17:30,650
You're going

446
00:17:31,320 --> 00:17:32,200
a bit too far.

447
00:17:34,080 --> 00:17:34,720
But

448
00:17:34,720 --> 00:17:37,320
I'm just following
your and Yishan's example.

449
00:17:37,840 --> 00:17:39,360
I'm not like Zhou Yan,

450
00:17:39,640 --> 00:17:40,840
who gets off work on time

451
00:17:40,840 --> 00:17:42,240
and is nowhere to be seen.

452
00:17:42,880 --> 00:17:44,880
I'll criticize him severely later.

453
00:17:51,360 --> 00:17:52,220
What do you say?

454
00:17:54,040 --> 00:17:55,520
This is getting tricky.

455
00:17:56,280 --> 00:17:58,920
Don't you have a lot of friends
and connections?

456
00:17:58,920 --> 00:18:00,240
Ask them for help.

457
00:18:00,440 --> 00:18:02,640
You dared to kill someone in the street.

458
00:18:02,720 --> 00:18:04,080
What do you expect others to do?

459
00:18:04,080 --> 00:18:05,600
Didn't I call them all back?

460
00:18:05,600 --> 00:18:07,040
Nothing happened, right?

461
00:18:07,040 --> 00:18:08,440
What are you yelling about?

462
00:18:08,440 --> 00:18:10,800
You should be glad nothing happened.

463
00:18:11,880 --> 00:18:12,540
Otherwise,

464
00:18:12,680 --> 00:18:14,280
our whole family would be in jail.

465
00:18:14,280 --> 00:18:14,810
Mom, Dad,

466
00:18:15,320 --> 00:18:16,280
our top priority now

467
00:18:16,280 --> 00:18:17,610
is to bail Xiaofeng out.

468
00:18:17,960 --> 00:18:19,960
Dad, think again if there's any other way.

469
00:18:19,960 --> 00:18:21,690
The procuratorate notified me

470
00:18:22,440 --> 00:18:23,640
to go there tomorrow.

471
00:18:28,120 --> 00:18:29,920
The day after Li Ran returned home
from the hospital,

472
00:18:29,920 --> 00:18:31,080
she sent a bunch of things

473
00:18:31,080 --> 00:18:32,960
to a third-party agency for testing.

474
00:18:32,960 --> 00:18:34,960
Abortion pills were detected

475
00:18:34,960 --> 00:18:37,020
in a newly opened bottle of vitamins.

476
00:18:38,440 --> 00:18:39,500
Take a look at this.

477
00:18:40,960 --> 00:18:41,690
The vitamins

478
00:18:41,840 --> 00:18:43,640
were given to her by Han Jiatong.

479
00:18:43,960 --> 00:18:45,680
But she never mentioned this.

480
00:18:45,960 --> 00:18:47,720
To be able to keep quiet until now,

481
00:18:47,720 --> 00:18:50,320
she has a pretty strong
psychological quality.

482
00:18:50,320 --> 00:18:51,240
The problem is,

483
00:18:51,240 --> 00:18:52,560
Han Jiatong won't admit

484
00:18:52,560 --> 00:18:54,080
she planted the abortion pills.

485
00:18:54,080 --> 00:18:55,320
We have purchase records

486
00:18:55,320 --> 00:18:57,380
and social media photos as evidence.

487
00:18:57,480 --> 00:18:58,680
Can she still deny it?

488
00:18:58,720 --> 00:19:00,600
No matter how tough she is,

489
00:19:00,920 --> 00:19:03,080
once we put the evidence in front of her,

490
00:19:03,080 --> 00:19:04,240
she'll definitely panic.

491
00:19:04,240 --> 00:19:05,040
Let's do this.

492
00:19:05,080 --> 00:19:06,960
We'll share this information
with the police first.

493
00:19:06,960 --> 00:19:08,020
We need to look into

494
00:19:08,160 --> 00:19:09,560
this Han Jiatong again.

495
00:19:10,320 --> 00:19:10,640
Understood.
